        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "dorga_powder_in"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_dorga_gift_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 25,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Take the Drilbur",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative givemon drilbur level=33"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add dorga_gift_done"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Drilbur joined you — dug straight out of the Deepcore lower gallery, and it has never once come up short.\",\"color\":\"gold\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "drilbur_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Keep it warm a moment longer",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Twelve measures of powder, dry and proper. The blast schedule is saved and so is my standing with the crew, which around here is worth more than the wage. So — square deal. The little digger sleeps in my tent and eats half my ration, and on my pay slip that is a debt I cannot carry. Take the Drilbur. It moves more rock in an hour than the whole gallery six roster, it deserves a trainer whose coin is not adjusting."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dorga — squared up",
                    Label: "drilbur_ready"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over 12 gunpowder",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative turnin minecraft:gunpowder 12 dorga_powder_in"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_dorga_gift_done"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "powder_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Payout came up short again. Same hours, same ore, less coin, and the slip has the nerve to call it a rate adjustment. Adjusting toward my pocket being empty, that is what it is adjusting."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Third quarter running the count on my slip has been light. You do a whole shift bent double in a wet gallery and the paper tells you your sweat is worth a bit less than last month. Prices are adjusting, my supervisor says. So is my patience."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Do not take a job below the frost line if you can help it, traveller. The pay is worse and the air is worse and lately the numbers are worse than both."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "And now they have gone and cut the haphazard pay. Which fits, honestly. Haphazard is exactly how that roof hangs over gallery six, and exactly how I expect to be paid for standing under it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Mind the tent, that is the blast kit under the tarp — or it would be, if the commissary had not re-verified my powder ration down to a stern note. Twelve measures of gunpowder gets gallery six blasted on schedule. Creepers drop it, if you have the nerve for that kind of shopping."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Dorga Flintpick",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
